---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Hoshiworks – Workflow & Automation Studio">
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-16">
    <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-6 text-center">
      <p class="text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-sky-300/80">
        Hoshiworks
      </p>

      <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">
        Workflow and automation that doesn’t fall apart under real work.
      </h1>

      <p class="text-base text-slate-300">
        A small studio helping small teams replace brittle spreadsheets and copy-paste ops
        with durable automations and simple, human-centered tools.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:justify-center">
        <a
          href="#intake"
          class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-5 py-2 text-sm font-medium bg-sky-400 text-slate-950 hover:bg-sky-300 transition"
        >
          Start a project
        </a>

        <a
          href="#how-it-works"
          class="text-sm text-slate-300 hover:text-slate-100"
        >
          See how it works →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How it works -->
  <section id="how-it-works" class="px-6 py-20 border-t border-slate-800">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto space-y-8">
      <div class="space-y-2 text-center">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">
          How a Hoshiworks project works
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">
          Three calm steps, no jargon. You bring the messy work; we bring structure and automations.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/40 p-5 text-sm space-y-2">
          <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-sky-300/80">
            Step 1
          </p>
          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold">Understand your work</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300">
            Two short conversations to map what your team actually does, where the friction lives,
            and which parts are worth automating.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/40 p-5 text-sm space-y-2">
          <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-sky-300/80">
            Step 2
          </p>
          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold">Build something that helps</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300">
            A 1–2 week sprint to build one meaningful automation or tool that saves real time
            and reduces “did anyone do that?” anxiety.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/40 p-5 text-sm space-y-2">
          <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-sky-300/80">
            Step 3
          </p>
          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold">Keep it running smoothly</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300">
            Light ongoing support so the automation doesn’t become another abandoned system
            when your tools or team change.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Services -->
  <section id="services" class="px-6 py-20 border-t border-slate-800">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto space-y-8">
      <div class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">
          What Hoshiworks can do for your team
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 max-w-2xl">
          Focused, project-shaped work for small teams who need better workflows —
          not a 200-page automation roadmap that never ships.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3 text-sm">
        <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/40 p-5 space-y-3">
          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold">Understand Your Work</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300">
            Two structured sessions to map your workflow, tools, and failure points.
            You leave with a clear picture of where automation will actually help.
          </p>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">
            Good if you know things feel messy but aren’t sure what to build yet.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/40 p-5 space-y-3">
          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold">Build Something That Helps</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300">
            A focused build sprint to deliver one automation or internal tool that removes
            a specific recurring headache from your team’s week.
          </p>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">
            Good if you have a clear “this is the annoying thing we keep doing by hand”.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/40 p-5 space-y-3">
          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold">Keep It Running Smoothly</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300">
            Light ongoing support to keep your workflows healthy as your tools, team,
            and data change over time.
          </p>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">
            Good if you’d like a reliable human to call when something breaks.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why Hoshiworks -->
  <section id="why" class="px-6 py-20 border-t border-slate-800">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-6">
      <div class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">
          Why Hoshiworks instead of another automation shop?
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 max-w-2xl">
          The goal isn’t to cram AI into everything — it’s to make the work less brittle,
          more humane, and easier to change as your organization evolves.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3 text-sm">
        <div class="space-y-2">
          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold">Small-team native</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300">
            Built for nonprofits, studios, and small businesses where “process” lives
            in a few brains and a lot of spreadsheets.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-2">
          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold">Human-centered tools</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300">
            Workflows are designed around how people actually communicate and decide things,
            not just what your tools can technically do.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-2">
          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold">Calm, honest scope</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300">
            Clear boundaries, no hype. Each project is scoped to something that can genuinely ship,
            not a fantasy platform your team will never maintain.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <footer class="px-6 py-10 border-t border-slate-800 text-xs text-slate-400">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
      <p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Hoshiworks. All rights reserved.</p>
      <div class="flex gap-4">
        <a href="#how-it-works" class="hover:text-slate-200">How it works</a>
        <a href="#services" class="hover:text-slate-200">Services</a>
        <a href="#intake" class="hover:text-slate-200">Start a project</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>
</Layout>
